        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the swarm in space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against endless enemies while piloting your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and grow stronger each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your module loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless module combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend and grow even stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prisms when you ascend based on your highest cleared sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them to unlock permanent upgrades in the ascension tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Defeat swarming enemies to collect resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Unlock and combine modules for unique builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Face harder waves as you push through sectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Ascend to reset your run and spend prisms on permanent upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Fast-paced incremental progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Roguelike module combinations for endless variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Permanent ascension tree upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Minimalist neon vector visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Short but replayable experience</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive the swarm in space</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against endless enemies while piloting your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources and grow stronger each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/f6422107ae17dee23bb89e14a2664f65.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your module loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with countless module combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different with roguelike upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/9631ba103df481335548080378e6e8d7.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ascend and grow even stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn prisms when you ascend based on your highest cleared sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend them to unlock permanent upgrades in the ascension tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.poster.avif?t=1772868557\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.webm?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964430/extras/8925ff4d5a9ff25ee81407d3ea91127f.mp4?t=1772868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Defeat swarming enemies to collect resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Unlock and combine modules for unique builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Face harder waves as you push through sectors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Ascend to reset your run and spend prisms on permanent upgrades</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Fast-paced incremental progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Roguelike module combinations for endless variety</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Permanent ascension tree upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t• Minimalist neon vector visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Short but replayable experience</p>",
